; GrassCommonTall — Grass terrain dressing (open_grass), the taller of the 2 grass picks.
; Source: Stylized Nature MegaKit (Standard/free), Quaternius, CC0 1.0 Universal — see
; project/attribution/sources/quaternius_stylized_nature_megakit.tres.
;
; Scale is a FIRST-PASS PROPOSAL (same reasoning as GrassCommonShort): raw mesh height
; 1.872695 units -> scaled to a stylized knee-height target of ~0.25 tile-units
; (scale 0.134), noticeably taller than the Short variant but still well under
; person-scale. FLAG FOR HUMAN SIGN-OFF.
;
; LOOK-PASS REWORK (2026-08-16): this scene was imported but never wired as a live
; model_scene or given the slab/scatter/floor treatment GrassCommonShort received earlier
; — it shipped as a single bare Model instance with no ground coverage at all. Brought up
; to the same standard now that D-42's model_scenes array lets Grass actually alternate
; between Short and Tall per tile:
;   - Slab BoxMesh (0.94x0.2x0.94, Color(0.42, 0.68, 0.3, 1)) — same grass-green as Short.
;   - 8 scattered instances of the same Grass_Common_Tall.gltf (fewer than Short's 10 —
;     tall blades read as visually "louder" per instance, so a lower count was used to
;     avoid the tile crossing from coverage into clutter; a judgment call, not measured).
;   - 2 blotchy floor patches (dark/light PlaneMesh), same technique and same reasoning as
;     GrassCommonShort's (no tileable grass ground texture exists in the audited packs).
; FLAG FOR HUMAN SIGN-OFF on density/scale, same as GrassCommonShort and every other piece
; of this pass.
;
; SLAB WIDENED 0.94 -> 1.0 (2026-08-16, human-reported cross-tile seam gap) — same fix,
; same exact-1.0-match reasoning as CommonTree1.tscn's header. X/Z only, Y (0.2) untouched.
; This scene is otherwise UNCHANGED by the 2026-08-16 grass follow-up pass (shorter/denser
; MultiMesh rework) — the human's complaint named Grass and Wild grass specifically;
; GrassCommonTall is not the terrain's default variant and reworking it too was judged out
; of scope for that fix (see GrassCommonShort.tscn's header for the full reasoning).
[gd_scene load_steps=8 format=3]

